    "terrainName": "basic-desert",
    "description": "What: CE-6008 (city battle L-1, lethality as scenario settings) - weapon ACCURACY is a scenario setting through the EXISTING side skill amplifier (SetSkillAmplifier, SR-100): the trigger 'Lethality: accuracy' sets Friend +2 tiers (Elite, spread x0.65) and Hostile -2 tiers (Untrained, spread x2.5) at 0 s. On open basic-desert two identical lanes 80 m apart: 'Blue Gunner' (Friend rifleman, InertSop) at (400,200) fires 30 rounds, one a second (FireAtPoint), at 'Red Target' 100 m north at (400,300); 'Red Gunner' (Hostile rifleman) at (480,200) fires the same at 'Blue Target' (480,300). Everyone immortal (100000 health). Judge (40 s): (1) both gunners fire all their rounds (2) Red Target loses far more health than Blue Target - the better-amplified side hits more. Change the tiers in the trigger to tune lethality per side (0 = everyone's own level). Fail: the two targets lose about the same. Check: the rail LethalityAccuracyScenarioTests; checks.json judges the targets stay put."
  },
